// Metrics of the library grid (css x 1.5): tile 134x200.99 css, x pitch 164.04 css (space-between across the row, items padded 8 css),
// row pitch 226 css (theme Library Move Extra Info: gap 25 css), scroll region padding 98/29.89/40/29.89 css.
